sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    U->>A: Hello
    A->>+B: Request
    B-->>-A: Reply
    A-)B: async
    A-xB: cross
    Note over A,B: A note
    loop Every minute
        A->>B: ping
    end
    alt ok
        B->>A: yes
    else fail
        B->>A: no
    end
    activate A
    deactivate A
